# Binaries the desktop build puts inside the app, per platform.
#
# Windows and macOS have no mpv the app can count on, so the installer carries one
# (tools/desktop/electron-builder.yml, extraResources). Nothing in this folder is committed: the
# binaries are tens of megabytes and built by other projects, so tools/desktop/fetch-mpv.sh puts
# them here before a build. A checkout without them still typechecks and tests; build-win.sh and
# build-macos.sh stop and say what is missing rather than shipping an app that cannot play.
#
# See "Bundling mpv" in docs/desktop.md.
mpv/
